    "description": "Front cover of the Dragon Ball manga special \"Trunks the Story –A Lone Warrior–\", published in 1992. Redrawn, recolored, expanded and animated. Color palette inspired by Dragon Ball FighterZ, made by yours truly.\r\n\r\nIf shared online, please state the source:\r\nInstagram: @mk_otaid\r\nReddit: u/Mk_0taid\r\nYoutube: @Mk_Otaid\r\n\r\nI spend a lot of time making these and ensuring they have as much of a handmade touch to them as possible. If you like my work, helping me to a cup of coffee means there is a crowd out there willing to support my efforts. Every litte bit helps: https://ko-fi.com/mk0taid\r\nIn return I can provide any one piece of your choosing for 4K download per donation (wallpaper or otherwise). Thank You all in advance!\r\n\r\nTechnical:\r\nResolution 2560 x 1440p. 8 total frames per moving piece, 6fps looped throughout 12 seconds. The video's framerate is 24fps so I'd recommend lowering Wallpaper Engine's fps to 24 and disabling all effects like MSAA and other post processes for optimal resource efficiency. The file itself is ~16MB so it should be pretty lightweight to run.\r\n\r\nSound not included. That is only there for the Youtube showcase.",
