    "title": "A Solitary Reflection [4K]",
    "description": "First wallpaper of 2026! I actually didn't plan on animating and finishing another wallpaper so soon, I was just checking if an animation effect I had in mind works and it did, then I just continued on and somehow spiraled into this.\r\n\r\nI chose a simpler artwork with more subtle animations that has greater emphasis on being an \"animated wallpaper\" rather than an \"animation\". This only took me around a week to finish everything from image editing to the animation. I should be more lazy in the future and choose artworks that don't require as much effort to animate it well.\r\n\r\nThanks to Zuc for giving me the idea for the name of the wallpaper. As always, hope you guys enjoy the wallpaper!\r\n\r\nP.S - For those who had downloaded this wallpaper when I first released it on 5th January, I made some small changes to this version so I recommend downloading and using this one instead of the previous version.\r\n\r\nMusic:\r\n\r\n[url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GaT5jaGEwzc] mxpheebz - The Beach [/url]\r\n\r\nOriginal Artwork can be found [url=https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/111332095] here (Made by Gracile) [/url]",
